[00:00.00] 作词 : Syd Barrett
[00:00.00][by:无为世界]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Syd Barrett
[00:27.74]The black and green scarecrow as everyone knows
[00:27.74]谁都知道黑黑绿绿的稻草人
[00:32.22]Stood with a bird on his hat and straw everywhere
[00:32.22]孤零零地站着 小鸟歇在他的帽子上 稻草遍布四周
[00:35.33]He didn't care
[00:35.33]他并不在意
[00:37.35]He stood in a field where barley grows
[00:37.35]依旧站在田野里 麦子肆意生长
[00:43.67]
[00:49.88]His head did no thinking
[00:49.88]他并不会思考
[00:52.02]His arms didn't move except when the wind cut up rough
[00:52.02]他的手臂木讷不动 除非狂风呼啸而过
[00:56.78]And mice ran around on the ground
[00:56.78]田鼠在田地里到处乱窜
[01:00.22]He stood in a field where barley grows
[01:00.22]他依旧站在田野里 麦子肆意生长
[01:06.82]
[01:12.91]The black and green scarecrow is sadder than me
[01:12.91]这个黑黑绿绿的稻草人比我还要悲惨
[01:17.47]But now he's resigned to his fate
[01:17.47]但现在他已甘愿接受命运的安排
[01:19.71]Because life's not unkind he doesn't mind
[01:19.71]因为生活并非那么残酷 他并不介意
[01:22.88]He stood in a field where barley grows
[01:22.88]依旧站在田野里 麦子肆意生长
